  (text "TJ Brain - Teensy 4.1 unit controller" (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 67c2cb53-8c0f-4f08-a1f4-035c45ce6d61))
  (text "One brain board per unit (female 1-3, male 1-2, bar). Unit role = DIP switch SW1 (read by firmware)." (at 25.4 21.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 592788fe-88ef-446d-9700-8be0f2b9251d))
  (text "Host link: USB from the backplane hub straight into the Teensy micro-USB. Power: Mini-Fit Jr 4p (+12V, +5V, GND, GND)." (at 25.4 23.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 18398cfa-f244-4d63-af33-dbfde3b73ff3))
  (text "Female: board on the static part, DA-15 BODY cable into the rotating body (pinout compatible with the ZKM electronic box)." (at 25.4 26.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 11af5522-f71c-41c4-9be1-2bd8f766059c))
  (text "Male / bar: same board, peripherals on the JST / terminal connectors or on the DA-15." (at 25.4 29.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 400d10a5-46bf-4077-9617-5cf4ef267d78))
  (text "Generated by CAD/KiCad/generator (python3 build_brain.py). Edit brain.py and regenerate rather than editing by hand." (at 25.4 31.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0b92801a-72a7-4625-9ab4-4ca860ba2f31))
